  sig=type DesktopLookFunc func(ctx context.Context, target string) (string, error)
  doc=DesktopLookFunc grounds the disposable desktop with the stateless MiMo v2.5\nomni vision call (DOJO req 3.2): it captures the desktop, invokes omni with a\nfixed grounding prompt and the given target, and returns structured text\n(interactive elements + a best click point, coordinates already rescaled to\nscreen pixels). It is the LAST rung of the driving ladder. Injected by the\nengine wiring; nil until a desktop session manager + omni client are wired.
EDGES
  ^references=matrix/neo/internal/server.NewEngine,matrix/neo/internal/tools.Manager,matrix/neo/internal/tools.Manager.SetDesktop
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/tools/tools.go

