NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/tools.validateToolArgs kind=func
  digest=b3:ea99e074617d79bb7f3acf1f53f0dacd708389641bdb1a13c7b3c0ec83bb0f0e file=neo/internal/tools/tools.go range=1868:1916 lang=go exported=false byte_range=80300:82303
  sig=func validateToolArgs(funcName string, params map[string]interface{}, args map[string]interface{}) (string, bool)
  doc=validateToolArgs checks a call's arguments against the tool's advertised JSON\nSchema before dispatch (errors that teach). It validates only the two mistakes\nan LLM actually makes — omitting a REQUIRED field, and passing a value whose\nJSON category clearly contradicts the declared type — and returns a corrective\nmessage that NAMES the field, its expected type, and a copy-pasteable example.\nIt is deliberately conservative on types (only clear object/array/scalar\ncategory mismatches, never scalar coercions a server would accept) so it never\nrejects a well-formed call over a constraint the model couldn't know from the\nschema. Returns ("", true) when the arguments are acceptable. The message\ncarries NO "class=" prefix — the dispatch ladder adds the failure-class prefix.
EDGES
  calls=matrix/neo/internal/tools.exampleForSchema,matrix/neo/internal/tools.isEmptyArg,matrix/neo/internal/tools.jsonTypeMatches,matrix/neo/internal/tools.jsonTypeName,matrix/neo/internal/tools.requiredFieldList
  references=matrix/neo/internal/tools.args,matrix/neo/internal/tools.ex,matrix/neo/internal/tools.exampleForSchema,matrix/neo/internal/tools.field,matrix/neo/internal/tools.funcName,matrix/neo/internal/tools.isEmptyArg,matrix/neo/internal/tools.jsonTypeMatches,matrix/neo/internal/tools.jsonTypeName,matrix/neo/internal/tools.k,matrix/neo/internal/tools.msg,matrix/neo/internal/tools.ok,matrix/neo/internal/tools.params,matrix/neo/internal/tools.present,matrix/neo/internal/tools.props,matrix/neo/internal/tools.r,matrix/neo/internal/tools.required,matrix/neo/internal/tools.requiredFieldList,matrix/neo/internal/tools.spec,matrix/neo/internal/tools.v,matrix/neo/internal/tools.want
  ^calls=matrix/neo/internal/tools.Manager.dispatch
  ^references=matrix/neo/internal/tools.Manager.dispatch
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/tools/tools.go

